    "name": "No Such Luck",
    "steam_appid": 3019400,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Such Luck tells the story of a young man who enters college after years of living on his own. He won the lottery, he got engaged - and then it all fell apart. Now ready to rejoin the world - reconnect with old friends, make new ones, all while trying to come to terms with the past. Of course college life comes with it's own set of challenges - sometimes, everything goes your way. Other times? No Such Luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Such Luck contains a wide cast of characters. Your choices help shape the state of the world and the MC. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current Contents:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019400/extras/6ca51a5a139fe23c65a29e2b81868d2e.avif?t=1754947357\" width=614 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Episode one consists of multiple hours of gameplay per playthrough, and follows the story over 4 total chapters:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019400/extras/b24533c631b3df9ff7ca9f5776d9600c.avif?t=1754947357\" width=614 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019400/extras/e0f4fa1f41ca4624805095d5741bcbef.avif?t=1754947357\" width=614 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019400/extras/d17890d455a8cd8af5e05f0a72a6203b.avif?t=1754947357\" width=614 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019400/extras/bec535ec03f037e298036218b53a07a1.avif?t=1754947357\" width=614 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019400/extras/de6be4bd1d8d7b00b6648199296784ef.avif?t=1754947357\" width=614 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Such Luck contains multiple easy to navigate freeroam events, a fully functional phone that updates with new apps and functionality throughout the course of the game, a dynamic biographies section to keep up to date with all characters, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episode one boasts over 10k total images, dozens of animations, and almost 200 uniquely scored music tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019400/extras/d5e9c5c140c59d4c01d21dfcbecd6fce.avif?t=1754947357\" width=624 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the Story you'll meet a whole host of characters - some important, and some just for fun! Included in the phone is a dynamic in-game biographies section which constantly updates info about those characters based on your progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019400/extras/2d712595cc2822f363a43346472c284d.avif?t=1754947357\" width=672 height=378 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Such Luck will continue to be updated as new Chapters and Episodes are released!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Such Luck tells the story of a young man who enters college after years of living on his own. He won the lottery, he got engaged - and then it all fell apart. Now ready to rejoin the world - reconnect with old friends, make new ones, all while trying to come to terms with the past. Of course college life comes with it's own set of challenges - sometimes, everything goes your way. Other times? No Such Luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Such Luck contains a wide cast of characters. Your choices help shape the state of the world and the MC. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current Contents:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019400/extras/6ca51a5a139fe23c65a29e2b81868d2e.avif?t=1754947357\" width=614 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Episode one consists of multiple hours of gameplay per playthrough, and follows the story over 4 total chapters:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019400/extras/b24533c631b3df9ff7ca9f5776d9600c.avif?t=1754947357\" width=614 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019400/extras/e0f4fa1f41ca4624805095d5741bcbef.avif?t=1754947357\" width=614 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019400/extras/d17890d455a8cd8af5e05f0a72a6203b.avif?t=1754947357\" width=614 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019400/extras/bec535ec03f037e298036218b53a07a1.avif?t=1754947357\" width=614 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019400/extras/de6be4bd1d8d7b00b6648199296784ef.avif?t=1754947357\" width=614 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Such Luck contains multiple easy to navigate freeroam events, a fully functional phone that updates with new apps and functionality throughout the course of the game, a dynamic biographies section to keep up to date with all characters, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episode one boasts over 10k total images, dozens of animations, and almost 200 uniquely scored music tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019400/extras/d5e9c5c140c59d4c01d21dfcbecd6fce.avif?t=1754947357\" width=624 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the Story you'll meet a whole host of characters - some important, and some just for fun! Included in the phone is a dynamic in-game biographies section which constantly updates info about those characters based on your progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019400/extras/2d712595cc2822f363a43346472c284d.avif?t=1754947357\" width=672 height=378 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Such Luck will continue to be updated as new Chapters and Episodes are released!</p>",
    "short_description": "As a young man, he left home immediately after high school, and has spent the last two years alone. He is finally ready to re-enter the world, ready to join his friends in college. Will it be drugs, sex and rock'n'roll? Or did he never truly get over what happened?",
